{"id":"447107","name":"花生红枣银耳汤","author":"@那时花开@","authorId":"91713","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/447107/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"丑耳","amount":"1朵"},{"name":"花生","amount":"20多粒"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"6颗"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"10多粒"}],"sub":[{"name":"冰糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"银耳提前泡发。","img":"images/447107/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"银耳去杂质撕小朵。","img":"images/447107/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入花生米。","img":"images/447107/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"一次性加入开水（冷水也行）","img":"images/447107/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"先高火煮开再转自动挡（晚上煮早上喝）","img":"images/447107/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"银耳软糯花生煮熟放入红枣。","img":"images/447107/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量的冰糖碎继续煮。","img":"images/447107/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"红枣煮熟加入枸杞。","img":"images/447107/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"焖几分钟即可。","img":"images/447107/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"滋阴润肺。","img":"images/447107/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品欣赏。","img":"images/447107/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品欣赏。","img":"images/447107/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、电压力锅、高压锅、汤锅、砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}